\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces FedRAS system architecture and round pipeline. The edge aggregator scores every client--rank pair with the delivery hazard \eqref  {eq:hazard} and the saturating capacity \eqref  {eq:cap}, and computes the client--rank assignment with the grid-based dynamic program under the byte budget and the admission cap. Updates arriving within the deadline $\tau $ pass the on-time gate and are aggregated with rank-masked averaging while the shared factor $A$ stays frozen; observed outcomes update the link-state history.}}{7}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{7}{}{}{}}
